WEBVTT

1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:01,800
Send this to the development manager for me to have it stamped

2
00:00:01,800 --> 00:00:03,600
Go on your own, I'm not free

3
00:00:03,600 --> 00:00:07,840
I was born like this when I first came here.

4
00:00:07,840 --> 00:00:10,530
A human being is tougher than a ghost doctor

5
00:00:10,530 --> 00:00:12,010
Who does he think he is?

6
00:00:12,010 --> 00:00:15,190
I'll find another chance to take revenge on him tomorrow

7
00:00:15,190 --> 00:00:23,090
Probably not

8
00:00:23,090 --> 00:00:26,680
I'll probably talk about something very important, Captain.

9
00:00:26,680 --> 00:00:28,480
He looks a little too normal

10
00:00:28,480 --> 00:00:30,140
Let his matters go first

11
00:00:30,140 --> 00:00:32,380
Even if he does it by some means unknown to us at noon today

12
00:00:32,380 --> 00:00:34,000
Avoided death

13
00:00:34,000 --> 00:00:36,300
The attention paid to him by the dungeon BOSS

14
00:00:36,300 --> 00:00:38,260
There is still danger around him

15
00:00:38,260 --> 00:00:40,260
There's nothing wrong with staying away from him

16
00:00:40,260 --> 00:00:42,580
If the remaining six days can remain as difficult as today

17
00:00:42,580 --> 00:00:44,700
Then I should live for six days

18
00:00:44,700 --> 00:00:45,900
Today is not over yet

19
00:00:45,900 --> 00:00:47,340
Night is the most dangerous time

20
00:00:47,340 --> 00:00:49,060
You don’t think dormitories are safer than offices, do you?

21
00:00:49,060 --> 00:00:50,340
The person sleeping next to you is a ghost doctor.
